/data/*
# real-inpainting overlays are REQUIRED for visual-matching eval: without
# them the eval used to silently fall back to raw sim rendering and produce
# skewed numbers (e.g. UniVLA eggplant 95.8% -> 8.3%). Keep them tracked.
!/data/real_inpainting/
demos/
videos/

# testing
.coverage*
htmlcov/